Z||000000||theogre||02-11-2001||04:45 PM||||In addition to premade connectors, MotorMite now stocks crimpers for Weather Pack and other GM terminal systems. (Will work with most "open barrel" connectors used in all cars) They also have a release tool for the Weather Pack terminals. Their release tool set has 2 small screw driver style tools and the tubular weather pack tool.<P><A HREF="http://www.lislecorp.com/" TARGET=_blank>Lysle</A> also has a release tool that is more GM specific.<P>I'll be writing this up in more detail over the next week. Keep an eye on the ECM section of the cave for more info.||||reg||10
